=\"e0b452dd8be3146b\" href=\"?note=e0b452dd8be3146b\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a36ff62aa04d500e\" href=\"?note=a36ff62aa04d500e\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-total-computable-function-notation</span><span>73-definition-7.5</span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.2–8.6 and §9.2, print pp. 324–374, 384–390; PDF pp. 346–396, 406–412; local function/enumerator presentation"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_numbering","html":"local-catalog; not book numbering"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§7.2–7.3 and §7.5, pp. 148–152, 159–166; local normalized model, not literal book tuple"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 是原接口的总函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>、停机与词输出图见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e0b452dd8be3146b\" href=\"?note=e0b452dd8be3146b\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a36ff62aa04d500e\" href=\"?note=a36ff62aa04d500e\" title=\"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance\">73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 在此为总字符串函数类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\)</span> 是其兼容别名；自然数载体的实例另由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"219767ec839d8c84\" href=\"?note=219767ec839d8c84\" title=\"73-df-numeric-program-interface\">73-df-numeric-program-interface</a> 的固定表示给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computable}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*:\n\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n(M(w)\\downarrow\\land\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=f(w))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computable}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*:\n\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n(M(w)\\downarrow\\land\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=f(w))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Computable}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Computable}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原文件把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 声明为总函数，故不将它改成部分函数类。数值输入的另一实例有明确的表示转换，而非把字符串函数直接作用于自然数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm","status":"resolved","id":"e0b452dd8be3146b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance","status":"resolved","id":"a36ff62aa04d500e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-numeric-program-interface]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm","status":"resolved","id":"e0b452dd8be3146b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$ 是原接口的总函数；$\\mathrm{TM}$、停机与词输出图见 [[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]、[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance","status":"resolved","id":"a36ff62aa04d500e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$ 是原接口的总函数；$\\mathrm{TM}$、停机与词输出图见 [[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]、[[73-df-seven-tuple-tm-acceptance]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-numeric-program-interface","status":"resolved","id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 在此为总字符串函数类，$\\mathrm{TotalComputable}$ 是其兼容别名；自然数载体的实例另由 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的固定表示给出。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotalComputable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Computable}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*:\n\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n(M(w)\\downarrow\\land\\operatorname{out}(M(w))\\downarrow=f(w))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.5}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TotalComputable}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Computable}","display":true},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":2290,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-total-computable-function-notation|total computable function notation]]"}],"outgoing":["e0b452dd8be3146b","a36ff62aa04d500e","0a6da8c909717780","219767ec839d8c84"]}